Count a bundled model-provider plugin as installed for the left-core migration.

Portage installs the github-copilot plugin into core's plugins/model-providers/,
where provider discovery loads it for every home. plugin_present() only looked
in <HERMES_HOME>/plugins/, so every start reported Copilot as "not installed,
so it is off" (security.allow_lazy_installs: false) or fetched a second copy
from the catalog.
Tracking: issues/hermes-agent-bundled-left-core-plugin.md

diff --git a/hermes_cli/left_core_migration.py b/hermes_cli/left_core_migration.py
